+{# Story 9.2 — full roles list region.
+
+   Variables:
+     assignments — tuple[RoleAssignmentRow, ...] in (first_seen_at, device_id) order
+     csrf_token  — string
+     gap_panel_oob — bool (when true, the gap panel is emitted as an HTMX
+                     out-of-band swap so the sibling region refreshes after
+                     an assign-route swap targeting #roles-list-region)
+     conflicts        — tuple[RoleConflict, ...]
+     blocking_gaps    — tuple[RoleGap, ...]
+     warning_gaps     — tuple[RoleGap, ...]
